AB  - This dataset contains JPEG images of cut cocoa beans organized for computer vision classification of fermentation grades. The images are associated with the article Classification of fermented cocoa beans (cut test) using computer vision, published in Journal of Food Composition and Analysis. The upload contains 206 images divided into two experiment batches: batch_01 with 101 images and batch_02 with 105 images. Images are organized by class labels inferred from the original filename prefixes: brown, partially brown, violet, slaty/moldy, and cutting-board images showing the cut-test structure. All files in this deposit are 4608 x 3456 px JPEG images with EXIF camera metadata indicating SONY DSC-W710. The accompanying manifest preserves the original filenames, new standardized paths, class labels, image dimensions, camera metadata, capture dates, and file sizes.
